      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buck_Meadows%2C_California",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A post office operated in Buck Meadows from 1915 until 1925, serving travelers on the historic route.",
